WEBVTT

00:02:28.796 --> 00:02:32.196
they were less likely to get
diabetes and heart disease,

00:02:32.196 --> 00:02:35.156
that they recovered faster from illness

00:02:35.196 --> 00:02:38.636
when they had better connections
with other people.

00:02:39.396 --> 00:02:41.796
So then the question is:
How could this work?

00:02:41.836 --> 00:02:46.636
How do relationships shape our happiness
and our physical health?

00:02:47.636 --> 00:02:49.716
Well, one of the best theories,

00:02:49.756 --> 00:02:52.316
for which there's now
some pretty good evidence,

00:02:52.356 --> 00:02:55.556
is based on the idea of stress.

00:02:55.596 --> 00:03:00.556
That, as we know, stress is an inevitable
part of all of our lives.